  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CREATION: G20 Engagement - Climate Adaptive Finance in Indonesia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Research on Climate Adaption Finance in Indonesia 2. Research dissemination to Civil Society Organisation (CSO) Network and build a collective recommendation upon that 3.     Conduct C20 Summit with Climate Change Adaptation as one of the issues, and ensuring gender -mainstreaming and space for public participation within the discussion</narrative>
